WEBVTT

01:25.300 --> 01:29.830
[Coroner's Diary]

01:30.750 --> 01:33.900
[Episode 12]

01:48.120 --> 01:48.920
That Sun Muqing

01:48.920 --> 01:50.310
definitely came for the medical fairy.

01:50.310 --> 01:52.280
As soon as he arrived in Jingzhou,
he asked everywhere for the medical fairy,

01:52.280 --> 01:53.640
never mentioned Miss Qin.

01:53.640 --> 01:54.490
It's just that

01:54.539 --> 01:55.990
four hours isn't enough time

01:55.990 --> 01:57.650
to get information
on the Medicine King Valley.

01:57.650 --> 01:59.509
Master, please give me more time.

02:02.160 --> 02:03.030
Let it go.

02:03.590 --> 02:05.850
Stop investigating this matter for now.

02:06.950 --> 02:10.030
The heir of the Marquis of Zhongyong,
Qin Yan, has already arrived in Jingzhou.

02:10.030 --> 02:10.960
So soon?

02:12.400 --> 02:13.000
By the way,

02:14.190 --> 02:15.190
news from the capital.

02:15.190 --> 02:16.120
The crown princess has been decided

02:16.120 --> 02:18.160
as Qin Zhaoyu, the eldest daughter
of the Marquis of Zhongyong.

02:18.160 --> 02:18.940
Qin Yan's purpose for this trip

02:18.940 --> 02:21.300
is to escort the three Their Ladyships
back to the capital for the New Year.

02:21.300 --> 02:22.490
Just the three Their Ladyships?

02:22.490 --> 02:22.930
Yes.

02:27.290 --> 02:28.910
If this was truly about family reunion
for the New Year,

02:28.910 --> 02:31.430
why would they only bring back
the three unmarried maidens

02:31.430 --> 02:34.230
and leave Third Madam and Qin Li alone
in Jingzhou?

02:35.000 --> 02:37.430
Could it be that the Marquis of Zhongyong
intends to select one of the three maidens

02:37.430 --> 02:39.260
to serve as concubine to the Crown Prince?

02:39.260 --> 02:40.840
The Crown Prince has only just
taken his position,

02:40.840 --> 02:43.430
and already the Marquis of Zhongyong
is rushing to use the Qin family maidens

02:43.430 --> 02:44.790
to gain political favour.

02:44.790 --> 02:46.030
If they want to return to the capital
for the New Year,

02:46.030 --> 02:47.210
they must depart soon.

02:47.210 --> 02:48.390
The further north they travel,
the colder it gets.

02:48.390 --> 02:49.390
And if they encounter heavy snow,

02:49.390 --> 02:51.650
the journey will be even more difficult.

02:53.440 --> 02:54.300
Your Highness,

02:54.590 --> 02:56.680
Huo Huaixin requests to see you.

03:09.190 --> 03:11.340
Your Highness is truly brilliant.

03:11.540 --> 03:12.650
No wonder you let go of

03:12.650 --> 03:14.870
the accountant from Qingyuan Pawnshop.

03:14.870 --> 03:16.590
He indeed had hidden a ledger.

03:16.870 --> 03:19.280
After obtaining the ledger, I investigated
through the night

03:19.280 --> 03:21.630
and discovered that two families
in the Jingzhou Prefecture

03:21.630 --> 03:23.160
are in collusion with them.

03:23.230 --> 03:26.090
I immediately ordered Constable Qi
to arrest them.

03:26.280 --> 03:29.210
They really thought I was
just a figurehead prefect.

03:29.550 --> 03:32.480
Hand over the ledger and the two families
to Bai Feng.

03:32.760 --> 03:35.260
Prefect Huo, you've made
a great achievement this time.

03:35.260 --> 03:37.600
I will certainly report this truthfully
to His Majesty.

03:37.600 --> 03:38.560
No, no.

03:38.590 --> 03:40.520
It is Your Highness
who deserves the main credit.

03:40.520 --> 03:42.190
I merely ran some errands.

03:42.770 --> 03:45.120
It's all thanks to
Your Highness's foresight

03:45.120 --> 03:47.630
and Miss Qin's tremendous help.

03:48.060 --> 03:50.800
Prefect Huo, how long will it take
to organize these files?

03:50.800 --> 03:52.540
About half a month,

03:52.620 --> 03:55.120
by which time Qin An's approval documents
should arrive.

03:55.120 --> 03:57.180
It must be completed within seven days.

03:57.180 --> 03:57.850
Well...

03:58.710 --> 04:00.590
If Prefect Huo can complete it
within seven days,

04:00.590 --> 04:01.710
I'll credit you with the main achievement

04:01.710 --> 04:02.710
for both cases.

04:04.080 --> 04:05.680
No, I couldn't possibly.

04:06.080 --> 04:08.800
I will definitely complete it
within seven days,

04:08.800 --> 04:09.860
I take my leave now.

04:17.680 --> 04:18.350
Master,

04:18.620 --> 04:20.680
there are still several months
until the year-end office closure.

04:20.680 --> 04:22.390
Why must it be completed
within seven days,

04:22.390 --> 04:24.920
giving him such a great achievement
for free?

04:25.070 --> 04:26.070
What do you think?

04:29.130 --> 04:31.730
You want to return to the capital
with Miss Qin.

04:34.159 --> 04:36.070
Keep watching the Marquis of Zhongyong

04:36.070 --> 04:38.930
and report everything to me,
no matter how trivial.

04:39.390 --> 04:40.070
Yes, sir.

04:53.920 --> 04:54.720
What?

04:55.640 --> 04:56.860
In just four days,

04:56.990 --> 04:58.280
you'll be leaving?

05:00.360 --> 05:03.270
What's wrong with
the Marquis of Zhongyong, Qin Shu?

05:03.270 --> 05:05.600
Why is he becoming more and more confused?

05:05.620 --> 05:08.080
Look at those families who secure favour
through marriage alliances,

05:08.080 --> 05:09.740
how many of them can last long?

05:10.310 --> 05:12.170
Just to flatter the Crown Prince,

05:12.190 --> 05:15.120
he makes everyone's New Year
anything but peaceful.

05:15.400 --> 05:16.190
Mother,

05:16.580 --> 05:18.460
please don't say such things.

05:20.590 --> 05:22.390
Wan is a sensible person,

05:22.410 --> 05:23.830
and we're all family here,

05:23.830 --> 05:25.530
what's wrong with speaking freely?

05:25.530 --> 05:26.480
Grand Princess,

05:26.750 --> 05:27.830
as you know,

05:27.830 --> 05:29.010
with my temperament,

05:29.010 --> 05:30.870
I can live comfortably anywhere.

05:31.240 --> 05:32.010
Today,

05:32.470 --> 05:34.700
I've come specifically
to bid you farewell.

05:34.700 --> 05:35.830
Please don't worry,

05:35.900 --> 05:37.510
there's no need to concern yourself
with me.

05:37.510 --> 05:38.530
The capital

05:38.950 --> 05:40.300
is a long journey away,

05:40.390 --> 05:41.240
and,

05:41.580 --> 05:43.270
the relationships there are complicated.

05:43.270 --> 05:44.310
When you're over there,

05:44.310 --> 05:46.190
without anyone who truly cares for you,

05:46.190 --> 05:47.870
how could I not worry?

05:48.650 --> 05:50.380
Once you've recovered,

05:50.409 --> 05:52.409
you can come visit me in the capital.

05:52.440 --> 05:53.240
Fuling.

05:54.700 --> 05:56.800
Here's a prescription I've written
for you.

05:56.800 --> 05:58.460
If you take your medicine on time
every day,

05:58.460 --> 05:59.810
keep your spirits up,

05:59.840 --> 06:01.070
and get some exercise,

06:01.070 --> 06:03.130
your health will certainly improve.

06:07.550 --> 06:09.350
Miss Qin has put in great effort.

06:11.090 --> 06:12.910
Mother, please don't worry.

06:13.380 --> 06:16.040
I'll go prepare some personal items
right away.

06:16.830 --> 06:18.040
When you arrive in the capital,

06:18.040 --> 06:19.950
you don't need to tiptoe around others.

06:19.950 --> 06:22.280
With Miss Qin's abilities and character,

06:22.390 --> 06:24.560
and the current situation
of the Qin family,

06:24.560 --> 06:25.770
returning to the capital

06:25.770 --> 06:28.030
will certainly offer better prospects.

06:31.310 --> 06:33.120
Of all the men the Marquis of Zhongyong
approved of,

06:33.120 --> 06:35.070
which one ever had a good future?

06:37.310 --> 06:38.830
Wan, remember,

06:39.200 --> 06:41.540
if your uncle tries to arrange
a careless marriage for you,

06:41.540 --> 06:42.909
you must stand up for yourself.

06:42.909 --> 06:44.980
Don't care about being filial.

06:45.430 --> 06:47.420
If you truly encounter difficulties,

06:47.420 --> 06:48.950
remember to have someone send word to me.

06:48.950 --> 06:49.890
At the very least,

06:49.890 --> 06:51.590
to the Emperor and
the Empress Dowager,

06:51.590 --> 06:53.190
I still have some influence.

06:54.470 --> 06:56.000
Thank you, Grand Princess.

06:57.390 --> 06:59.050
Why must Little Wan'er leave?

06:59.230 --> 07:00.720
She's my only friend.

07:00.980 --> 07:02.170
What will I do if she leaves?

07:02.170 --> 07:02.970
Ning,

07:03.430 --> 07:04.800
you're being petulant again.

07:04.800 --> 07:06.810
That's the main branch of the Qin family,

07:06.810 --> 07:08.000
her own uncle.

07:08.240 --> 07:09.580
We have no relation to them,

07:09.580 --> 07:11.180
we have no say in this matter.

07:14.300 --> 07:16.480
Grandma, Father, Mother,

07:16.740 --> 07:18.070
I have something to say.

07:21.640 --> 07:22.190
I...

07:23.750 --> 07:24.920
I... I want to marry...

07:24.920 --> 07:26.680
Great Aunt, if you want to protect
Miss Qin,

07:26.680 --> 07:27.900
it can be quite simple.

07:27.900 --> 07:29.020
I have a solution.

07:30.830 --> 07:31.710
What solution?

07:31.960 --> 07:33.420
Great Aunt, Uncle and Aunt

07:33.600 --> 07:35.800
treat Miss Qin like their own daughter,

07:36.020 --> 07:37.159
why not have Uncle and Aunt

07:37.159 --> 07:38.800
adopt Miss Qin as their daughter?

07:38.800 --> 07:39.450
This way,

07:39.680 --> 07:41.190
Great Aunt gains a granddaughter,

07:41.190 --> 07:42.040
and the Marquis of Zhongyong

07:42.040 --> 07:44.070
can't interfere with Miss Qin's marriage
anymore,

07:44.070 --> 07:45.930
killing two birds with one stone.

07:45.960 --> 07:46.990
Then Little Wan'er

07:46.990 --> 07:49.390
would become my real sister, wouldn't she?

08:07.750 --> 08:09.310
Well, Your Grace

08:09.990 --> 08:10.800
and Madam,

08:10.920 --> 08:12.390
what do you think?

08:13.390 --> 08:15.870
Chi had already mentioned this to me,

08:16.130 --> 08:18.060
and I'm certainly pleased with it.

08:19.030 --> 08:19.830
Madam,

08:20.000 --> 08:21.200
what's your opinion?

08:21.610 --> 08:22.680
I agree as well.

08:23.070 --> 08:23.830
Good.

08:25.330 --> 08:26.260
Grand Princess.

08:26.760 --> 08:28.120
Today, we'll do as I say.

08:29.120 --> 08:31.070
We don't need to hold a grand banquet,

08:31.070 --> 08:32.320
we'll just invite Prefect Huo

08:32.320 --> 08:34.010
to witness this for all of us.

08:34.270 --> 08:36.750
Tomorrow, Your Grace and Third Madam

08:36.770 --> 08:38.500
will have an adopted daughter.

08:38.690 --> 08:40.049
From now on,

08:40.620 --> 08:42.020
I will have

08:42.120 --> 08:43.470
another granddaughter.

08:43.470 --> 08:46.470
Ning and Qing'er will have a new sister.

08:46.500 --> 08:47.390
From now on,

08:47.970 --> 08:49.590
your fortune and misfortune,
honor and disgrace

08:49.590 --> 08:52.070
will be shared with the Marquis Mansion.

08:52.820 --> 08:54.350
Thank you, Grand Princess.

08:55.030 --> 08:56.720
Little Wan'er, this is wonderful!

08:56.720 --> 08:58.980
From now on, you'll be my younger sister.

09:04.910 --> 09:07.060
[Lin Courtyard]

09:07.160 --> 09:08.280
Come here.

09:24.000 --> 09:25.200
Everyone be careful.

09:27.550 --> 09:29.610
[Take Wan as my adopted daughter]

10:43.210 --> 10:45.730
Little Wan'er, call me sister

10:45.760 --> 10:48.360
and I'll teach you
how to use this sleeve arrow.

10:48.730 --> 10:50.680
What's with this "Little Wan'er"?

10:51.260 --> 10:52.260
You

10:52.290 --> 10:53.220
should call her

10:53.270 --> 10:54.440
Fourth...

10:54.830 --> 10:55.470
Sister.

10:56.000 --> 10:56.880
Yes.

10:57.560 --> 10:59.440
Fourth Sister.

11:00.710 --> 11:02.040
Thank you, Sister.

11:05.450 --> 11:06.490
This child.

11:06.920 --> 11:08.550
The brothers all gave her

11:08.630 --> 11:09.720
inkstones,

11:09.720 --> 11:11.980
medical books and other cultured items.

11:12.000 --> 11:13.570
Yet you, as her sister,

11:13.760 --> 11:15.030
give her such a weapon.

11:15.330 --> 11:16.660
What's wrong with that?

11:17.150 --> 11:19.750
My Fourth Sister is destined
for great things.

11:19.910 --> 11:22.000
She needs this kind of hidden weapon
for self-defence

11:22.000 --> 11:23.400
to be properly equipped.

11:23.670 --> 11:25.400
Ning is being thoughtful.

11:25.740 --> 11:26.760
After all, Wan

11:27.070 --> 11:28.530
is a delicate young woman.

11:29.090 --> 11:30.640
Being alone outside,

11:30.670 --> 11:33.320
she must learn ways to protect herself.

11:38.030 --> 11:39.480
I, Ning, beg you, Grandma

11:39.480 --> 11:40.550
and Mother, to be merciful

11:40.550 --> 11:43.010
and allow me to accompany Wan
to the capital.

11:44.040 --> 11:44.910
Don't be ridiculous.

11:44.910 --> 11:45.480
Get up.

11:45.480 --> 11:46.940
I'm not being ridiculous.

11:47.030 --> 11:48.910
Grandma, I'm making this request

11:48.910 --> 11:51.370
firstly because Wan has
no personal guards.

11:51.630 --> 11:53.150
If we encounter ordinary thieves,

11:53.150 --> 11:53.990
with my skills,

11:53.990 --> 11:55.650
I can fully ensure her safety.

11:55.910 --> 11:56.670
Secondly,

11:57.690 --> 12:00.350
I haven't been back to the capital
for ten years.

12:01.320 --> 12:02.080
I wish...

12:03.270 --> 12:05.070
I wish that before I get married,

12:05.120 --> 12:06.810
I could go back there one more time.

12:06.810 --> 12:08.260
You're a young lady,

12:08.760 --> 12:10.630
you shouldn't be talking about marriage.

12:10.630 --> 12:11.790
Mother,

12:11.820 --> 12:13.960
you've already been arranging matches
for me in secret,

12:13.960 --> 12:15.220
why can't I speak of it?

12:16.000 --> 12:16.830
Anyway,

12:17.080 --> 12:18.560
if you don't agree,

12:18.580 --> 12:20.040
I won't get married at all.

12:22.550 --> 12:24.050
When Wan returns to the capital,

12:24.050 --> 12:25.050
I will definitely

12:25.120 --> 12:26.790
arrange personal guards

12:26.790 --> 12:28.050
to protect her safety.

12:28.480 --> 12:29.720
If you wish,

12:30.030 --> 12:31.190
after you're married,

12:31.190 --> 12:33.120
you can also return to the capital.

12:33.270 --> 12:34.510
Mother,

12:34.510 --> 12:36.170
please stop trying to fool me.

12:36.920 --> 12:38.040
Grandma in her day

12:38.060 --> 12:40.610
was also a heroine who rode horses
and wielded bows.

12:40.610 --> 12:42.290
Why is it that
after she married Grandfather,

12:42.290 --> 12:44.210
she never returned to the capital?

12:44.210 --> 12:46.070
Was it because she didn't want to?

12:46.150 --> 12:47.610
Have I spoiled you too much

12:47.960 --> 12:48.790
that you think you can

12:48.790 --> 12:50.990
speculate about your elders' affairs?

12:51.520 --> 12:52.790
Let her be.

12:54.720 --> 12:55.480
Mother.

12:55.740 --> 12:56.550
This child...

12:57.560 --> 12:59.290
I understand Ning's thoughts.

12:59.600 --> 13:01.870
Let her accompany Wan.

13:02.190 --> 13:03.180
After all,

13:03.440 --> 13:04.630
after marriage,

13:04.630 --> 13:07.240
the days of freedom will be gone.

13:07.680 --> 13:08.810
Thank you, Grandma.

13:09.300 --> 13:10.610
Grandma!

13:12.060 --> 13:13.300
Grandma is the best.

13:14.530 --> 13:15.390
Little Wan'er,

13:16.040 --> 13:17.480
we can go to the capital together now.

13:17.480 --> 13:18.790
That's wonderful!

13:19.110 --> 13:19.910
Thank you, Grandma.

13:19.910 --> 13:21.040
Thank you, Grandma.

13:22.120 --> 13:23.780
That's great, Little Wan'er.

13:36.130 --> 13:38.290
[Title Deed]

13:43.450 --> 13:43.970
Come.

13:49.710 --> 13:50.780
Grand Princess.

13:51.120 --> 13:52.120
This is too valuable,

13:52.120 --> 13:53.120
I can't accept it.

13:54.880 --> 13:56.040
Call me Grandma.

13:57.790 --> 13:58.420
Grandma.

13:59.820 --> 14:00.550
These things

14:00.630 --> 14:02.360
are for you to keep as security.

14:03.000 --> 14:03.670
Remember,

14:03.930 --> 14:05.740
when dealing with the Qin family,

14:05.740 --> 14:06.540
don't mention

14:06.870 --> 14:08.320
a single word about this.

14:09.720 --> 14:11.320
When you're alone out there,

14:11.520 --> 14:13.190
be careful at all times,

14:13.270 --> 14:13.910
alright?

14:17.240 --> 14:18.370
Thank you, Grandma.

14:42.480 --> 14:44.080
How did Your Highness get in?

14:44.130 --> 14:45.370
I learned it from Li,

14:45.860 --> 14:46.960
to avoid prying eyes

14:46.960 --> 14:48.620
and enter through the window.

15:18.280 --> 15:20.100
Your Highness, sneaking into
a private home at night

15:20.100 --> 15:21.160
is against the law.

15:24.200 --> 15:25.930
There's a good reason for this.

15:27.370 --> 15:28.430
Today I discovered

15:28.600 --> 15:29.790
that Qingyuan Pawnshop

15:29.790 --> 15:30.810
and the Jingzhou garrison's

15:30.810 --> 15:32.810
deputy commander are in collusion.

15:33.130 --> 15:35.190
That's why I rushed here from my post.

15:35.390 --> 15:36.590
Did you catch anyone?

15:36.720 --> 15:37.440
No,

15:38.000 --> 15:39.260
the suspect heard rumours

15:39.260 --> 15:40.600
and escaped beforehand.

15:40.600 --> 15:42.600
But Bai Feng has gone to investigate.

15:42.600 --> 15:44.660
Then why did Your Highness come back?

15:45.870 --> 15:47.600
I had planned to leave with you,

15:47.910 --> 15:49.000
but now it seems

15:49.390 --> 15:51.190
I'll need to wait a few more days.

15:51.270 --> 15:52.070
So,

15:52.390 --> 15:54.390
I wonder if you'll leave with Qin Yan

15:54.480 --> 15:55.510
or wait for me?

15:58.350 --> 15:59.910
I am a daughter of the Qin family,

15:59.910 --> 16:01.610
I should go with Qin Yan,

16:01.960 --> 16:03.320
to avoid gossip

16:03.350 --> 16:05.550
and difficult explanations
to the Marquis of Zhongyong.

16:05.550 --> 16:06.480
You have a point.

16:07.240 --> 16:08.500
Since Qin Yan arrived,

16:08.640 --> 16:11.840
I can't hold you back under the pretext
of formal matters.

16:24.720 --> 16:27.250
This is the token of
the Prince Rui's Mansion.

16:27.440 --> 16:28.770
Keep it for protection.

16:29.910 --> 16:32.020
I can't accept such a valuable token.

16:32.540 --> 16:34.140
Qin Yan has personal guards,

16:34.300 --> 16:36.050
and Your Ladyship is returning to
the capital with me,

16:36.050 --> 16:37.150
nothing bad will happen.

16:37.150 --> 16:38.530
If you encounter common bandits,

16:38.530 --> 16:39.930
they can still handle it,

16:39.930 --> 16:41.440
but if you meet corrupt officials,

16:41.440 --> 16:44.200
this token will be more effective
than anything they have.

16:44.200 --> 16:45.730
In winter, there are many refugees
in the north,

16:45.730 --> 16:46.920
and there's no shortage of

16:46.920 --> 16:48.730
corrupt officials who aid the wicked.

16:48.730 --> 16:50.010
Just keep this token

16:50.640 --> 16:51.640
as your talisman.

16:54.830 --> 16:55.640
Then you...

16:58.760 --> 17:01.420
How long will Your Highness
remain in Jingzhou?

17:02.000 --> 17:03.790
Once I catch that traitor in the army,

17:03.790 --> 17:04.920
I'll come after you.

17:05.640 --> 17:06.369
Don't worry.

17:08.550 --> 17:10.220
Your Highness is wise and capable,

17:10.220 --> 17:11.470
I have no concerns.

17:17.069 --> 17:17.880
May...

17:19.040 --> 17:20.240
May I use your daybed?

17:28.319 --> 17:29.840
You can't rest here!

17:30.130 --> 17:32.260
I need to return to my post before dawn.

17:32.490 --> 17:35.350
I'm too exhausted to go back
to the Marquis Mansion.

18:33.470 --> 18:36.410
[Marquis of Anyang's Mansion]

18:36.540 --> 18:37.490
Ning.

18:38.930 --> 18:39.850
Look at you,

18:39.880 --> 18:41.010
so reckless.

18:41.260 --> 18:42.700
Dressed like this,

18:43.280 --> 18:45.250
you hardly look like a lady
from a noble family.

18:45.250 --> 18:46.680
I think Ning looks exceptionally spirited

18:46.680 --> 18:47.810
dressed this way.

18:49.400 --> 18:50.360
Mother.

18:50.710 --> 18:52.910
I'm now Little Wan'er's personal guard.

18:52.910 --> 18:54.560
if I dress too elaborately,

18:54.580 --> 18:56.640
it will slow down my sword-drawing speed.

18:56.640 --> 18:57.580
All right.

18:57.880 --> 18:59.000
Heroine Yue,

19:00.110 --> 19:01.000
promise me,

19:01.890 --> 19:03.130
on this journey,

19:03.240 --> 19:04.370
you must be careful.

19:04.850 --> 19:05.570
Mother,

19:05.690 --> 19:06.540
brother,

19:06.680 --> 19:07.830
don't worry about me,

19:07.830 --> 19:09.490
I'll take good care of myself.

19:10.020 --> 19:10.950
I'm leaving now,

19:14.550 --> 19:15.950
take care of yourselves.

19:21.840 --> 19:22.600
Take care.

19:28.270 --> 19:30.330
Just make sure you protect yourself.

19:32.460 --> 19:33.590
Xiang,

19:33.610 --> 19:35.770
you must listen to Cousin Yan
on the journey,

19:35.770 --> 19:36.900
and don't be wilful.

19:39.270 --> 19:40.990
Shuang'er, remember this,

19:41.210 --> 19:42.680
once you enter the Marquis Mansion,

19:42.680 --> 19:44.240
you must know your place

19:44.890 --> 19:46.720
and stop being as reckless

19:46.830 --> 19:48.360
and troublesome as before.

19:49.030 --> 19:49.640
Yes.

19:51.510 --> 19:52.560
Your uncle

19:53.570 --> 19:55.170
values rules above all else.

19:55.710 --> 19:57.740
After you enter the Marquis Mansion,

19:57.740 --> 19:59.860
you must behave properly

19:59.890 --> 20:02.750
and never give anyone reason
to find fault with you.

20:02.750 --> 20:03.950
Don't worry, Mother.

20:04.260 --> 20:05.910
When I am at the capital,

20:05.930 --> 20:08.330
I'll be the true Ladyship
of the Marquis Mansion.

20:08.330 --> 20:09.840
Let's see who dares to pick on me.

20:09.840 --> 20:10.600
Xiang.

20:10.620 --> 20:11.420
Steward Zhou.

20:11.610 --> 20:13.410
-It’s a long journey.
-Xiang.

20:13.650 --> 20:17.050
You absolutely must stop
being so competitive and stubborn.

20:17.630 --> 20:18.860
Your eighth sister

20:19.350 --> 20:21.680
is your aunt's precious darling.

20:22.110 --> 20:23.490
After entering the Marquis Mansion,

20:23.490 --> 20:25.970
you must control your temper

20:26.000 --> 20:27.660
and be humble when necessary.

20:27.960 --> 20:30.530
As long as you please your uncle and aunt,

20:30.560 --> 20:32.690
your marriage prospects will be good.

20:33.090 --> 20:34.870
I understand, Mother.

20:36.720 --> 20:37.440
Aunt.

20:38.680 --> 20:39.880
We've packed almost everything.

20:39.880 --> 20:40.880
We can depart now.

20:41.000 --> 20:42.600
Thank you for your help, Yan.

20:45.790 --> 20:46.940
Please don't worry.

20:46.960 --> 20:49.750
I'll take full responsibility
for all three sisters' safety.

20:49.750 --> 20:50.310
Good.

20:50.460 --> 20:51.660
Bid farewell to Li.

20:56.720 --> 20:57.650
I'll see you off.

21:02.640 --> 21:03.480
Li.

21:03.980 --> 21:04.910
I'm leaving now.

21:05.190 --> 21:05.990
Wan.

21:08.400 --> 21:10.230
Wan, I am useless.

21:10.880 --> 21:12.940
This is all I've saved over the years.

21:13.140 --> 21:14.830
Please don't think it's too little.

21:14.830 --> 21:16.700
Li, what do you mean?

21:17.190 --> 21:19.390
Qin Xiang has her mother's protection,

21:19.400 --> 21:21.770
and even if Qin Shuang is deemed
not as outstanding,

21:21.770 --> 21:23.500
she won't be treated too badly.

21:23.750 --> 21:25.920
But you'll be alone in the capital.

21:26.930 --> 21:29.040
Keep this money for emergencies.

21:29.430 --> 21:29.990
Here.

21:36.350 --> 21:37.240
This is enough.

21:37.450 --> 21:39.980
Consider it payment
for my medical services.

21:40.000 --> 21:40.720
Wan.

21:40.750 --> 21:41.310
Li.

21:41.790 --> 21:43.810
The third branch of the family
depends on you now.

21:43.810 --> 21:45.910
Whether you're born of the main wife
or a concubine,

21:45.910 --> 21:47.180
in my heart,

21:47.210 --> 21:49.270
you will always be my second brother.

21:53.400 --> 21:54.230
Wan.

21:54.920 --> 21:56.350
I won't let you down.

21:58.110 --> 21:59.040
I'm leaving now.

22:46.500 --> 22:47.350
Father.

22:48.240 --> 22:49.030
Mother.

22:50.370 --> 22:53.200
Your daughter, I, can finally go
to the capital as wished.

22:53.200 --> 22:54.460
No matter how powerful

22:54.590 --> 22:56.180
those who harmed you may be,

22:56.780 --> 22:58.510
I will do everything in my power

22:58.770 --> 23:00.530
to clear your names.

23:03.590 --> 23:05.250
Your Ladyship, please drink.

23:05.670 --> 23:07.190
You two, come with me.

23:07.710 --> 23:09.200
It's not even winter month yet,

23:09.200 --> 23:10.420
how can it be so cold?

23:10.550 --> 23:12.910
Why did we have to abandon
the water route?

23:12.930 --> 23:15.550
We can't even hire a carriage
in this backwater place.

23:15.550 --> 23:17.720
Can we even reach the posthouse tonight?

23:17.720 --> 23:18.720
Just bear with it.

23:19.030 --> 23:20.630
It gets colder as we go north,

23:20.900 --> 23:24.880
and in a few days the canal will freeze over
and boats won't be able to pass.

23:24.880 --> 23:27.040
Your Ladyship is so knowledgeable.

23:32.840 --> 23:34.040
In such cold weather,

23:34.200 --> 23:37.400
how much longer will Little Wan'er
stand there watching?

23:43.480 --> 23:44.280
My Lady,

23:49.360 --> 23:51.560
standing in the wind for too long
will make you catch cold.

23:51.560 --> 23:52.510
Let's go inside.

23:53.250 --> 23:54.200
These tea pastries

23:54.200 --> 23:55.590
are our local specialty.

23:55.590 --> 23:57.450
Ladies, please help yourselves.

24:01.930 --> 24:02.830
Have some hot tea.

24:02.830 --> 24:04.070
Little Wan'er, this is quite delicious,

24:04.070 --> 24:05.070
try some quickly.

24:13.330 --> 24:15.200
The Yunwu Mountain area is famous for tea,

24:15.200 --> 24:17.860
these tea pastries truly have
a unique flavour.

24:23.000 --> 24:24.400
Your Ladyship, sisters,

24:25.000 --> 24:26.510
we've finally found a carriage.

24:26.510 --> 24:28.270
But it's getting dark early.

24:28.310 --> 24:29.030
Tonight,

24:29.030 --> 24:31.560
I'm afraid we'll need to find lodging
nearby.

24:33.160 --> 24:33.820
Innkeeper,

24:34.580 --> 24:36.780
is there an inn nearby where we can stay?

24:37.590 --> 24:38.880
There's one up ahead.

24:38.880 --> 24:41.200
Just follow the main road,

24:41.200 --> 24:43.530
past Sanyuan Village and you'll reach it.

24:44.310 --> 24:45.400
It's just that...

24:46.220 --> 24:47.020
What is it?

24:47.640 --> 24:48.590
It's just that in recent months,

24:48.590 --> 24:50.400
Sanyuan Village hasn't been peaceful.

24:50.400 --> 24:51.660
If you're going there,

24:51.670 --> 24:53.070
you'd better leave soon,

24:53.170 --> 24:55.210
it gets too dangerous after dark.

24:55.240 --> 24:56.090
Innkeeper,

24:56.110 --> 24:58.240
what happened in the Sanyuan Village?

24:58.400 --> 24:59.400
I've heard that

24:59.550 --> 25:01.200
the village is haunted by monsters,

25:01.200 --> 25:03.530
and they come out after dark
to eat people.

25:04.880 --> 25:07.360
In broad daylight, how could there
be monsters?

25:07.360 --> 25:08.750
Exactly. With me here,

25:08.770 --> 25:10.430
we needn't fear any monsters.

25:10.560 --> 25:11.980
The wise don't speak of
supernatural things.

25:11.980 --> 25:14.060
Your Ladyship needn't believe such
hearsay from the backwoods.

25:14.060 --> 25:15.460
The carriage is waiting at the entrance.

25:15.460 --> 25:17.720
Your Ladyship and ladies, please get in.

25:22.310 --> 25:23.570
Be careful, everyone.

26:02.960 --> 26:03.510
Let's go.

26:05.790 --> 26:06.640
Stop looking,

26:06.670 --> 26:07.200
hurry up.

26:20.300 --> 26:21.450
[Fortune Inn]

26:58.400 --> 26:59.000
Don't go!

26:59.610 --> 27:00.130
Stop!

27:20.850 --> 27:21.650
Wan,

27:22.070 --> 27:23.350
we should leave.

27:23.750 --> 27:25.920
In broad daylight, what monsters
could there be?

27:25.920 --> 27:26.750
Exactly.

27:27.320 --> 27:28.780
Besides, you have me here.

27:28.830 --> 27:30.190
Little Wan'er, let's go.

27:30.190 --> 27:30.750
Let's go.

27:31.190 --> 27:31.800
Come on.

27:35.190 --> 27:36.960
Distinguished guests from afar,

27:36.960 --> 27:38.090
please come inside.

27:38.650 --> 27:40.920
It looks like heavy snow will soon
block the mountain passes.

27:40.920 --> 27:43.010
My place is the best option now.

27:43.350 --> 27:45.030
The main rooms are the cleanest,

27:45.030 --> 27:46.400
please rest assured.

27:46.420 --> 27:47.450
Come, this way please.

27:47.450 --> 27:48.520
Have some hot tea.

27:49.950 --> 27:50.560
Come in.

27:55.070 --> 27:55.510
Here.

27:57.610 --> 27:59.790
Innkeeper, quickly prepare something,

27:59.790 --> 28:01.000
everyone's starving.

28:01.000 --> 28:01.860
Little Wan'er,

28:02.750 --> 28:04.310
come, have some hot tea first.

28:04.310 --> 28:05.310
Innkeeper,

28:05.310 --> 28:06.710
why are there

28:06.740 --> 28:08.660
garlic and animal horns hanging on
all the village doors?

28:08.660 --> 28:09.740
What are they for?

28:10.190 --> 28:10.990
Well...

28:11.020 --> 28:12.450
My Lady, I'll wait outside.

28:12.450 --> 28:13.650
We heard earlier

28:14.130 --> 28:16.660
that this area has been troubled
by monsters.

28:21.110 --> 28:22.440
Since you already know,

28:22.770 --> 28:24.160
I won't hide it from you.

28:24.790 --> 28:26.760
There used to be a large tea plantation
in the hills behind here

28:26.760 --> 28:28.160
that was doing very well.

28:28.360 --> 28:29.760
But about six months ago,

28:30.100 --> 28:33.290
several people died one after another
at that plantation.

28:33.290 --> 28:34.610
Young workers

28:34.630 --> 28:37.090
mysteriously disappeared without a trace.

28:37.920 --> 28:39.580
When their bodies were found,

28:39.680 --> 28:41.830
all their organs had been removed.

28:42.680 --> 28:44.720
It was a horrific way to die.

28:46.720 --> 28:47.830
Could it have been

28:48.510 --> 28:49.920
wild animals from the mountains?

28:49.920 --> 28:52.480
The hunters practically turned
the Yunwu Mountain upside down,

28:52.480 --> 28:54.320
but they didn't find any trace
of wild beasts.

28:54.320 --> 28:55.790
With such a serious matter,

28:55.790 --> 28:57.200
didn't the authorities investigate?

28:57.200 --> 28:57.930
They did.

28:58.310 --> 28:59.590
The officials investigated for months

28:59.590 --> 29:00.680
but found nothing.

29:00.900 --> 29:01.930
That's when rumours started

29:01.930 --> 29:04.860
about a monster in the tea plantation
eating people.

29:05.110 --> 29:06.600
But don't worry, distinguished guests,

29:06.600 --> 29:08.140
since the plantation was shut down,

29:08.140 --> 29:10.550
there haven't been any deaths
for over a month.

29:10.550 --> 29:11.880
But we're not monsters.

29:12.310 --> 29:13.070
Why are these villagers

29:13.070 --> 29:15.000
looking at us with such hostility?

29:15.440 --> 29:16.790
The villagers are ignorant.

29:16.790 --> 29:19.550
They say too many outsiders
have been coming here,

29:19.550 --> 29:21.580
bringing unclean things into the village

29:21.580 --> 29:23.410
and causing all these troubles.

29:23.830 --> 29:24.590
That's why

29:24.720 --> 29:25.770
Sanyuan Village

29:25.990 --> 29:28.080
has become what it is today.

29:30.640 --> 29:31.710
Cui!

29:32.850 --> 29:34.440
Cui!

29:37.550 --> 29:38.350
Cui!

29:38.350 --> 29:38.880
Ma'am.

29:38.880 --> 29:40.270
My dear Cui!

29:40.820 --> 29:42.820
-Be careful.
-Cui.

29:45.440 --> 29:48.240
How can Grandma go on without you?

29:48.810 --> 29:49.850
My poor Cui.

29:49.880 --> 29:50.730
Wan.

29:51.920 --> 29:53.320
Hurry! Everyone follow!

29:54.070 --> 29:58.160
Cui, what happened to you?

29:58.160 --> 29:58.880
Come.

30:00.200 --> 30:01.480
Cui.

30:11.500 --> 30:12.260
Careful now.

30:12.480 --> 30:14.340
The Feng family line is finished.

30:14.510 --> 30:15.440
What do you mean?

30:15.960 --> 30:18.170
That old woman is Mrs. Feng
from the eastern village,

30:18.170 --> 30:20.310
whose son and daughter were
killed by demons.

30:20.310 --> 30:22.810
She only had one granddaughter left
to live with.

30:22.810 --> 30:23.810
By the looks of it,

30:25.810 --> 30:26.850
I pray

30:26.870 --> 30:29.110
nothing happens to my inn.

30:29.360 --> 30:30.160
Wan,

30:30.860 --> 30:32.260
we cannot stay here long.

30:33.920 --> 30:35.390
Make those outsiders get out!

30:35.390 --> 30:36.540
-Get out!
-Yes!

30:36.590 --> 30:38.310
Make those outsiders leave!

30:38.310 --> 30:39.310
Get out!

30:39.310 --> 30:40.670
How dare you, insolent peasants!

30:40.670 --> 30:42.270
Stop this commotion at once!

30:43.400 --> 30:44.030
Mr. Huang,

30:44.030 --> 30:45.350
w-what are you doing?

30:45.350 --> 30:47.280
Telling these outsiders to leave.

30:47.410 --> 30:48.500
Our Sanyuan Village

30:48.500 --> 30:50.240
finally had a few days of peace,

30:50.500 --> 30:52.330
but as soon as these outsiders arrived,

30:52.330 --> 30:53.790
Cui was met with disaster.

30:54.290 --> 30:56.440
If these outsiders stay,

30:56.530 --> 30:58.680
who knows who'll be next to die.

30:59.720 --> 31:01.830
Make these outsiders
leave the Sanyuan Village territory,

31:01.830 --> 31:04.270
Get out! Get out!

31:04.270 --> 31:05.530
Everyone, attention!

31:05.880 --> 31:06.940
Protect the women,

31:07.440 --> 31:09.530
and arrest all these troublemakers.

31:10.790 --> 31:11.810
What are you doing?

31:11.810 --> 31:12.870
What are you doing?

31:13.500 --> 31:14.830
We're not afraid of you!

31:14.830 --> 31:16.240
Trying to bully us?

31:19.160 --> 31:20.310
Make them leave!

31:20.310 --> 31:20.880
Get out!

31:20.880 --> 31:23.160
Leave now!

31:25.890 --> 31:28.240
Cousin Yan, the locals here are fierce.

31:28.260 --> 31:29.440
If a real conflict breaks out,

31:29.440 --> 31:30.470
there will surely be casualties.

31:30.470 --> 31:31.470
Don't worry, Wan.

31:31.960 --> 31:33.270
These few troublemakers

31:33.270 --> 31:35.160
are no match for
the Marquis Mansion guards.

31:35.160 --> 31:35.620
Attack!

31:37.700 --> 31:38.430
Don't!

31:38.640 --> 31:39.240
Danger!

31:45.740 --> 31:46.530
Stop!

31:58.530 --> 32:07.490
Doctor Sun. Doctor Sun.

32:10.890 --> 32:11.960
Doctor Sun.

32:11.980 --> 32:14.020
Doctor Sun, what brings you here?

32:14.430 --> 32:16.400
Senior was treating Mrs. Feng.

32:16.420 --> 32:18.280
I heard the noise and rushed here.

32:18.330 --> 32:19.530
With heavy snow coming,

32:19.530 --> 32:20.660
driving people away now

32:20.660 --> 32:22.170
is pushing them toward certain death,
isn't it?

32:22.170 --> 32:22.820
But...

32:22.850 --> 32:24.180
They can stay at Herbal Garden.

32:24.180 --> 32:27.600
[Medicine King Valley, Sun Haoyue]

32:25.030 --> 32:26.000
No, no!

32:26.000 --> 32:27.400
-What if they bring you trouble?
-Don't worry.

32:27.400 --> 32:28.110
They won't.

32:29.350 --> 32:30.200
Senior.

32:31.210 --> 32:32.030
Senior Sun.

32:32.060 --> 32:33.070
-You may leave.
-Let me through.

32:33.070 --> 32:33.930
Junior Sister!

32:34.320 --> 32:35.630
What are you doing here?

32:35.630 --> 32:36.240
Let...

32:36.330 --> 32:37.310
Let me introduce.

32:37.310 --> 32:38.000
This person here

32:38.000 --> 32:39.070
is the legendary

32:39.090 --> 32:40.350
Senior disciple from
the Medicine King Valley,

32:40.350 --> 32:41.290
Sun Haoyue.

32:41.360 --> 32:41.960
Greet him.

32:43.010 --> 32:44.860
Qin Wan pays respects to Senior Brother.

32:44.860 --> 32:46.790
Senior, this is our junior sister,

32:47.000 --> 32:47.850
Qin Wan.

32:49.200 --> 32:50.740
Since you completed your training and
left the mountain,

32:50.740 --> 32:52.670
she's become Master's favourite.

32:53.110 --> 32:53.970
Hello, Junior.

32:56.160 --> 32:57.170
So you two

32:57.430 --> 32:58.800
are Wan's seniors.

32:59.580 --> 33:01.210
I am Wan's cousin, Qin Yan.

33:01.240 --> 33:02.070
It's my pleasure today

33:02.070 --> 33:04.410
to meet the two divine doctors from
Medicine King Valley

33:04.410 --> 33:05.540
I'm truly honoured.

33:05.650 --> 33:06.650
Young Master Qin.

33:08.110 --> 33:09.110
Let's depart now.

33:09.260 --> 33:09.700
Okay.

33:10.200 --> 33:11.260
Where are we going?

33:11.680 --> 33:13.830
We're going to Senior's Herbal Garden.

33:13.830 --> 33:15.270
Since they won't let you stay here
anymore,

33:15.270 --> 33:16.530
where else could we go?

33:18.970 --> 33:20.830
[Herbal Garden]

33:33.980 --> 33:35.480
Young Master, you're back.

33:35.480 --> 33:35.960
Mr. Dong.

33:35.960 --> 33:36.790
Let me take that.

33:36.790 --> 33:37.630
How is my wife?

33:37.660 --> 33:38.660
She's doing well.

33:38.910 --> 33:40.150
These are my friends.

33:40.170 --> 33:41.990
Please arrange accommodations for them.

33:41.990 --> 33:43.060
I'll go check on her.

33:43.060 --> 33:43.590
Alright.

33:44.950 --> 33:46.190
Divine doctor?

33:46.210 --> 33:47.740
He's being quite rude here.

33:48.580 --> 33:50.490
Madam is seriously ill.

33:50.520 --> 33:52.390
Young Master has always taken care of her
personally

33:52.390 --> 33:53.720
and never delegates this duty to others.

33:53.720 --> 33:55.310
He doesn't mean to slight you all.

33:55.310 --> 33:56.440
Please understand.

33:56.900 --> 33:58.560
Doctor Sun's devotion to his wife

33:58.560 --> 33:59.690
is truly admirable.

34:00.090 --> 34:01.780
This residence is quite spacious.

34:01.780 --> 34:03.110
Please make yourselves at home

34:03.110 --> 34:04.880
as if you were in your own house.

34:04.900 --> 34:06.130
Don't stand on ceremony.

34:06.130 --> 34:06.930
Thank you.

34:07.220 --> 34:08.550
Come, please go inside.

34:14.110 --> 34:15.239
This way, sir.

34:21.870 --> 34:22.420
Junior.

34:23.560 --> 34:24.960
Where's that Yan fellow?

34:25.130 --> 34:27.320
How dare he let you enter the capital
alone?

34:27.320 --> 34:29.429
Senior, you're talking nonsense again.

34:29.429 --> 34:31.050
Lord Yan isn't my bodyguard.

34:31.080 --> 34:33.320
What would it mean if he followed me
everywhere?

34:33.320 --> 34:34.170
Let me tell you,

34:34.170 --> 34:36.139
we're fortunate to have met Senior Haoyue
this time,

34:36.139 --> 34:39.000
otherwise you all would be sleeping
on the streets.

34:39.630 --> 34:41.159
So where is that Yan fellow?

34:41.440 --> 34:42.230
Senior.

34:43.290 --> 34:45.690
How did you know Senior Brother
lives here?

34:45.920 --> 34:46.920
Well, let me tell you,

34:46.920 --> 34:48.520
after I left Jingzhou,

34:48.889 --> 34:50.630
I heard about a compassionate doctor

34:50.630 --> 34:52.830
named Doctor Sun at the Yunwu Mountain.

34:53.190 --> 34:54.350
So I came to meet him.

34:54.370 --> 34:55.330
And when we met,

34:55.800 --> 34:56.730
guess who it was?

34:57.100 --> 34:58.940
It was our Senior Haoyue!

35:00.890 --> 35:02.580
Since he completed his training and left,

35:02.580 --> 35:04.130
we haven't seen each other
for so many years.

35:04.130 --> 35:04.990
This meeting

35:05.190 --> 35:06.470
must be our fate.

35:06.600 --> 35:07.480
The three of us

35:07.620 --> 35:09.410
must have a good exchange of knowledge.

35:09.410 --> 35:09.850
Okay.

35:10.010 --> 35:11.410
Little Wan'er, hurry up!

35:11.720 --> 35:12.280
Coming!

35:12.380 --> 35:13.070
Let's go.

35:20.460 --> 35:21.720
I'm freezing to death!

35:25.170 --> 35:27.030
Treatment prescription.

35:27.680 --> 35:28.730
Ginkgo nuts.

35:28.760 --> 35:31.290
Thank goodness your senior has
such a large house.

35:31.290 --> 35:32.960
If I have to cramp together with your two

35:32.960 --> 35:34.480
like I did on the boat,

35:34.510 --> 35:36.170
I would really start cursing.

35:36.590 --> 35:38.320
Though this place is a bit chilly,

35:38.320 --> 35:40.320
the atmosphere is quite wonderful.

35:40.360 --> 35:42.630
I heard your senior's wife isn't in
good health.

35:42.630 --> 35:45.090
This place seems suitable for her recovery.

35:45.400 --> 35:47.530
Isn't your senior a divine physician?

35:47.590 --> 35:49.400
How come he can't even cure his own wife?

35:49.400 --> 35:51.030
A great doctor isn't a deity,

35:51.110 --> 35:53.110
some illnesses are beyond healing.

35:53.230 --> 35:54.370
My Lady, Your Ladyship,

35:54.370 --> 35:55.760
Mr. Dong has brought the bedding.

35:55.760 --> 35:57.020
I'll go make your beds.

35:57.510 --> 35:59.190
Fuling, just give me mine.

35:59.570 --> 36:00.090
Here.

36:01.320 --> 36:02.960
No, um...

36:03.710 --> 36:05.710
Your Ladyship, let me make your bed.

36:05.800 --> 36:06.360
No need,

36:06.360 --> 36:08.090
just make Little Wan'er's bed.

36:08.310 --> 36:10.040
Let's take a walk in the garden.

36:11.880 --> 36:12.740
I don't want to.

36:13.000 --> 36:15.130
I woke up way too early today,

36:15.280 --> 36:16.740
I need to catch up on sleep.

36:35.670 --> 36:37.670
There are no monsters in this world,

36:37.870 --> 36:39.560
but the Feng family's granddaughter's arm

36:39.560 --> 36:41.020
was dry as a withered bone.

36:41.260 --> 36:43.750
There were no blood stains on the linen
nor wooden boards.

36:43.750 --> 36:46.890
Clearly all blood was drained
from her body when she died.

36:46.890 --> 36:48.950
How could any human possibly do this?

36:58.730 --> 37:01.590
How long will Your Highness be delayed
in Jingzhou?

37:02.030 --> 37:03.700
Once I catch that traitor in the army,

37:03.700 --> 37:04.830
I'll come after you.

37:05.710 --> 37:06.440
Don't worry.

37:10.630 --> 37:12.030
With Lord Yan's help,

37:12.500 --> 37:15.100
I will surely expose that monster's
true form.

37:15.240 --> 37:16.160
But,

37:16.650 --> 37:18.290
when will he arrive?

37:35.880 --> 37:37.790
Master, would you like to rest
for a while?

37:37.790 --> 37:38.600
No,

37:38.730 --> 37:40.030
it's about to snow again,

37:40.030 --> 37:41.490
and the horses won't run fast on
nowy paths,

37:41.490 --> 37:42.730
making it even harder to catch up
with them.

37:42.730 --> 37:44.170
But you've been riding all day.

37:44.170 --> 37:45.430
I'm not that delicate.

40:08.360 --> 40:09.070
Miss Qin,

40:09.340 --> 40:10.490
did I startle you?

40:10.520 --> 40:12.140
This is Young Master's patient.

40:12.140 --> 40:14.070
Why did the Senior lock the patient
in here?

40:14.070 --> 40:15.400
This patient suffers from hysteria,

40:15.400 --> 40:17.660
and often hurts others during episodes.

40:24.700 --> 40:25.960
What's wrong with him?

40:26.440 --> 40:27.980
He gets like this during an episode,

40:27.980 --> 40:30.240
which is why Young Master kept him here
for treatment,

40:30.240 --> 40:32.070
to prevent him from harming others
or himself.

40:32.070 --> 40:32.900
Miss Qin,

40:33.030 --> 40:34.780
please go somewhere else for now,

40:34.780 --> 40:36.780
I need to give him his medicine.

40:37.720 --> 40:39.780
Thank you for your trouble, Mr. Dong.

40:49.930 --> 40:51.370
Senior, are you alright?

40:51.800 --> 40:52.800
I'm fine.

40:53.350 --> 40:54.950
Were you going to meet Sister-in-Law?

40:54.950 --> 40:56.550
-I haven’t...
-I know the way.

40:56.550 --> 40:57.510
I'll take you there. Let's go.

40:57.510 --> 40:58.070
Alright.

41:13.970 --> 41:14.900
It's just ahead.

41:18.270 --> 41:19.100
It's this way.

41:20.560 --> 41:22.130
[Benevolent Heart]

41:31.710 --> 41:32.640
Senior Brother.

41:34.300 --> 41:36.050
Junior Brother. Little Junior Sister.

41:36.050 --> 41:37.650
Greetings, Senior Brother.

41:38.000 --> 41:39.060
This is my brother-in-law,

41:39.060 --> 41:40.020
Bai Feijue.

41:40.040 --> 41:41.570
Thank you, Senior Brother.

41:41.950 --> 41:43.350
Nice to meet you, Mr. Bai.

41:43.490 --> 41:45.220
Thank you for your help, Senior Brother.

41:45.220 --> 41:47.360
Or else we wouldn't have a place to stay.

41:47.360 --> 41:48.950
I, Qin Wan, am truly grateful.

41:48.950 --> 41:50.950
Miss Qin, please don't be so formal.

41:51.050 --> 41:53.410
There's no need for such formalities
between fellow disciples.

41:53.410 --> 41:54.710
Though the Herbal Garden is modest,

41:54.710 --> 41:56.180
it is spacious and open.

41:56.960 --> 41:59.170
Junior Sister, feel free to look around.

41:59.170 --> 42:00.380
Compared to the Medicine King Valley,

42:00.380 --> 42:01.910
it has its own unique charm.

42:02.280 --> 42:04.070
I heard your wife is unwell.

42:04.070 --> 42:06.020
After I pay my respects to her,

42:06.040 --> 42:08.330
I will certainly enjoy
exploring this place.

42:08.330 --> 42:09.660
You're too kind, Junior Sister.

42:09.660 --> 42:11.440
Feiyan, as the lady of the house,
should have been the one

42:11.440 --> 42:12.750
to welcome you, Junior Sister.

42:12.750 --> 42:14.260
Unfortunately, she's not feeling well.

42:14.260 --> 42:16.350
So please forgive our poor hospitality.

42:16.350 --> 42:17.850
You say there's no need for formalities,

42:17.850 --> 42:19.710
yet you're the most formal of all.

42:19.920 --> 42:21.780
Alright, take us to see your wife.

42:22.560 --> 42:24.110
It's kind of you to think of Feiyan.

42:24.110 --> 42:24.710
Well then,

42:24.830 --> 42:25.580
follow me.

42:30.670 --> 42:31.600
Please, come in.

43:16.000 --> 43:17.830
Your sister-in-law suffers from insomnia
due to her illness.

43:17.830 --> 43:19.520
She needs the Yunmeng Incense
I specially prepared for her

43:19.520 --> 43:20.430
to fall asleep,

43:20.620 --> 43:22.620
which most people cannot tolerate.

43:27.260 --> 43:28.830
She just took her medicine and
fell asleep.

43:28.830 --> 43:29.830
You can look at her

43:29.920 --> 43:30.730
from here.

43:31.870 --> 43:32.580
Alright.

43:55.140 --> 43:55.970
Let's go back.
